{"id": null, "n": "0457002", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0457002", "type": "mod", "text": "（西天…譯）三十字【大】，宋西天三藏朝散大夫試鴻臚卿宣梵大師日稱等奉詔譯【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0457003", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0457003", "type": "mod", "text": "起【大】，起起【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0457004", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0457004", "type": "mod", "text": "隣【大】，迷【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0457005", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0457005", "type": "mod", "text": "是【大】，足【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0457006", "target": "#nkr_note_mod_0457006", "type": "mod", "text": "成【大】，或【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0457001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0457001", "type": "orig", "text": "此經宋本元本俱無"}
{"id": null, "n": "0457002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0457002", "type": "orig", "text": "（（西天…譯））三十字＝（（宋西天三藏朝散大夫試鴻臚卿宣梵大師日稱等奉詔譯））二十三字【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0457003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0457003", "type": "orig", "text": "（起）＋起【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0457004", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0457004", "type": "orig", "text": "隣＝迷【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0457005", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0457005", "type": "orig", "text": "是＝足【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0457006", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0457006", "type": "orig", "text": "成＝或【明】"}
{"id": null, "n": "0457c1801", "target": "#nkr_note_add_0457c1801", "type": "add", "text": "足【大】【磧-CB】，是【麗-CB】"}
